  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is GEF PPG FARM for Lao PDR. The main objective of this ppg is to prepare a full-size project 4 million with required annexes and CEO Endorsement Request. The project aimed to implement in 2024 which the main implementing partner if Department of Agriculture under Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry. The project will help the government in reducing harmful chemicals use in the agriculture sector and provide alternative options and helping farmers to access finance.</narrative>
  </description>
